  <p>We maintain 7 dedicated English training plans specifically engineered for this physiological framework, available in our training plan library. They range from 8 to 16 weeks, and are separated by your preferred execution metric: Heart Rate or Pace.</p>
  <p>These plans automate the 80/20 polarization. They program the low zone 2 days explicitly for fasted morning execution, and isolate the high-intensity work so you know exactly which days require carbohydrate loading.</p>
